### Specs
- **535 questions**: mix of mcq, msq, order, match types
- **9 iterations × 5 rounds × 15 questions** = 75 per iteration (675 total slots, covers all 535≥1x)
- **Pass score**: 70%
- **Seeded shuffle**: xorshift PRNG (`seed * 2654435761`), NOT LCG. Zero-safe (seed=0→1).
- **Coverage algorithm** (`getQuestionsForRound`): scans ALL localStorage `aif_iter_X_round_Y` keys and `_seen` backup keys, builds seen set. If unseen ≥ 15, picks 15 from unseen (shuffled). If unseen < 15, includes ALL unseen + fills from seen shuffled. **Guarantees 100% coverage** — every question appears at least once across all 9 iterations.
- **Question cache** (`_currentQuestions`): set once in `startRound`, used by `selectOption`, `selectMatch`, `moveOrderItem`, `submitRound` — prevents `getQuestionsForRound` from returning different questions on each answer click. Fixes submit button staying disabled.
- **Dynamic Select instruction**: MSQ instruction shows correct count via `numToWords(q.answer.length)` — supports ONE through TEN.
- **Round results**: include domain breakdown (same bar-style as iteration results)
- **Iteration results**: "View Iteration Results" button appears after 5th round submit (uses `.results-summary` class)
- **Retake**: `retakeRound` backs up old answers to `_seen` key before removing. `retakeIteration` also backs up each round. Coverage preserved across retakes.

